{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>沙田有人猝死。昨日（14日）晚上9時許，一名44歲龍姓男子在碩門邨豐碩樓住所暈倒，家人見狀報案。</p><p>救護員接報到場，證實事主當場死亡，事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><figure><img alt=\"沙田碩門邨有人猝死。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198490328609329152875649.jpeg/VsQk0033snTN8-OKplUSlZjqnVBWlX6yHGtg_RxrYP0\"/><figcaption>沙田碩門邨有人猝死。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T20:50:27.828978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T20:18:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:13:04.153749+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T20:43:51.600574+00:00","content_hash":"c7a59ea49a3c1df8759af89fb87f0f171cfcbc2a67fb4a29a5b1f81996eb2690","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}